    "NSEvent 读数可能已包含映射结果；tap 诊断记录处理前后压力，两类事件流不逐条对应。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NSEvent 读数可能已包含映射结果；tap 诊断记录处理前后压力，两类事件流不逐条对应。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NSEvent may already include mapped pressure. Tap diagnostics record input and output separately; the streams do not match event for event."
          }
        }
      }
    },
