    "标识为系统 / 驱动报告值，0 可能是占位。同型号归组无法区分缺少唯一标识的多支笔；无事件不代表断开。最多保留 32 个身份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标识为系统 / 驱动报告值，0 可能是占位。同型号归组无法区分缺少唯一标识的多支笔；无事件不代表断开。最多保留 32 个身份。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IDs are reported by the system or driver; zero may be a placeholder. Model groups cannot distinguish pens without unique IDs. Silence does not mean disconnection. Up to 32 identities are retained."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "橡皮擦": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "橡皮擦"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eraser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在挤压": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在挤压"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Squeezing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此处的曲线和入锋 / 出锋仅属于当前设备。配置中选择继承的应用会共同使用它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此处的曲线和入锋 / 出锋仅属于当前设备。配置中选择继承的应用会共同使用它。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These curve and taper settings belong only to this device and are shared by apps that inherit them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "此身份按型号归组，不能区分多支同型号的笔；重命名不改变匹配身份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此身份按型号归组，不能区分多支同型号的笔；重命名不改变匹配身份。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This identity groups pens by model and cannot distinguish identical pens. Renaming does not change matching."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每台设备同时启用一个配置，各设备互不影响。保存从下一笔生效；禁用或暂停立即停止修改。首次启用后请让笔重新进入感应范围。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台设备同时启用一个配置，各设备互不影响。保存从下一笔生效；禁用或暂停立即停止修改。首次启用后请让笔重新进入感应范围。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enable one profile per device; devices work independently. Saved settings apply from the next stroke. Disabling or pausing stops changes immediately. Bring the pen back into range after first enabling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每台设备独立设置，配置中的应用默认继承所属设备。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台设备独立设置，配置中的应用默认继承所属设备。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure each device separately. Apps in a profile inherit that device’s defaults."
          }
        }
      }
    },
