    "窗口移到 iPad 并激活后测试。双击需在显示器设置中启用；挤压需 Pencil Pro。仅记录本窗口手势，不归属某支笔，也不代表可监听其他应用手势。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗口移到 iPad 并激活后测试。双击需在显示器设置中启用；挤压需 Pencil Pro。仅记录本窗口手势，不归属某支笔，也不代表可监听其他应用手势。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move this window onto the iPad and activate it. Enable double tap in display settings; squeeze requires Pencil Pro. Gestures belong to this window, not a specific pen, and do not represent other apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
